                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "我看看，\n{A笑眯眯}植物玩偶的标签上，写着“云果”，\n茶点玩偶的标签上，写着“莫白”……",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203104001_3144803753_content",
                "value": "我看看，\n{A笑眯眯}植物玩偶的标签上，写着“云果”，\n茶点玩偶的标签上，写着“莫白”……",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
